{
  "chapters": [],
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "section",
      "number": "202",
      "id": "202",
      "title": "New tax regime for individuals, Hindu undivided family and others.",
      "x": 27.62,
      "y_start": 80.59,
      "page_start": 1,
      "page_end": 1,
      "text_before_subsections": "",
      "subsections": [
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "1",
          "id": "202-1",
          "x": 27.62,
          "y_start": 95.44,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text_before_clauses": "Irrespective of anything contained in this Act other than Chapter XVII-B but subject to Parts A, B, E and this Part of this Chapter, the income-tax payable by a person, being—",
          "clauses": [
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "a",
              "id": "202-1-a",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 395.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "an individual; or",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "b",
              "id": "202-1-b",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 415.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "a Hindu undivided family; or",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "c",
              "id": "202-1-c",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 430.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "an association of persons (other than a co-operative society); or",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "d",
              "id": "202-1-d",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 450.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "a body of individuals, whether incorporated or not; or",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "e",
              "id": "202-1-e",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 395.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "an artificial juridical person referred to in section 2(77)(g), in respect of the total income for a tax year, shall, unless the person exercises the option in the manner provided under sub-section (4), be computed at the rate of tax given in the following Table:—",
              "children": [],
              "table": {
                "type": "table",
                "id": "202-1-e-table",
                "x": 27.62,
                "y_start": 150.0,
                "page_start": 1,
                "page_end": 1,
                "columns": [
                  "Sl. No.",
                  "Total income",
                  "Rate of tax"
                ],
                "rows": [
                  {
                    "sl_no": "1",
                    "total_income": "Upto Rs. 400000",
                    "rate_of_tax": "Nil"
                  },
                  {
                    "sl_no": "2",
                    "total_income": "From Rs. 400001 to Rs. 800000",
                    "rate_of_tax": "5%"
                  },
                  {
                    "sl_no": "3",
                    "total_income": "From Rs. 800001 to Rs. 1200000",
                    "rate_of_tax": "10%"
                  },
                  {
                    "sl_no": "4",
                    "total_income": "From Rs. 1200001 to Rs. 1600000",
                    "rate_of_tax": "15%"
                  },
                  {
                    "sl_no": "5",
                    "total_income": "From Rs. 1600001 to Rs. 2000000",
                    "rate_of_tax": "20%"
                  },
                  {
                    "sl_no": "6",
                    "total_income": "From Rs. 2000001 to Rs. 2400000",
                    "rate_of_tax": "25%"
                  },
                  {
                    "sl_no": "7",
                    "total_income": "Above Rs. 2400000",
                    "rate_of_tax": "30%"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "text_after_clauses": ""
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "2",
          "id": "202-2",
          "x": 27.62,
          "y_start": 380.0,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text_before_clauses": "For the purposes of sub-section (1), the total income of the assessee shall be computed—",
          "clauses": [
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "a",
              "id": "202-2-a",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 395.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "without any exemption or deduction under—",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "sub-clause",
                  "number": "i",
                  "id": "202-2-a-i",
                  "x": 55.0,
                  "y_start": 465.0,
                  "page_start": 1,
                  "page_end": 1,
                  "text": "Schedule III (Table: Sl. No. 5 or 6 or 7 or 8 or 11 or 17);"
                },
                {
                  "type": "sub-clause",
                  "number": "ii",
                  "id": "202-2-a-ii",
                  "x": 55.0,
                  "y_start": 480.0,
                  "page_start": 1,
                  "page_end": 1,
                  "text": "Schedule III (Table: Sl. No. 12 or 13) (other than those as may be prescribed for this purpose);"
                },
                {
                  "type": "sub-clause",
                  "number": "iii",
                  "id": "202-2-a-iii",
                  "x": 55.0,
                  "y_start": 465.0,
                  "page_start": 1,
                  "page_end": 1,
                  "text": "25[]"
                },
                {
                  "type": "sub-clause",
                  "number": "iv",
                  "id": "202-2-a-iv",
                  "x": 55.0,
                  "y_start": 480.0,
                  "page_start": 1,
                  "page_end": 1,
                  "text": "section 19(1) (Table: Sl. No. 1);"
                },
                {
                  "type": "sub-clause",
                  "number": "v",
                  "id": "202-2-a-v",
                  "x": 55.0,
                  "y_start": 465.0,
                  "page_start": 1,
                  "page_end": 1,
                  "text": "section 22(1)(b), in respect of properties referred to in section 21(6);"
                },
                {
                  "type": "sub-clause",
                  "number": "vi",
                  "id": "202-2-a-vi",
                  "x": 55.0,
                  "y_start": 480.0,
                  "page_start": 1,
                  "page_end": 1,
                  "text": "section 33(8);"
                },
                {
                  "type": "sub-clause",
                  "number": "vii",
                  "id": "202-2-a-vii",
                  "x": 55.0,
                  "y_start": 465.0,
                  "page_start": 1,
                  "page_end": 1,
                  "text": "section 48;"
                },
                {
                  "type": "sub-clause",
                  "number": "viii",
                  "id": "202-2-a-viii",
                  "x": 55.0,
                  "y_start": 480.0,
                  "page_start": 1,
                  "page_end": 1,
                  "text": "section 49;"
                },
                {
                  "type": "sub-clause",
                  "number": "ix",
                  "id": "202-2-a-ix",
                  "x": 55.0,
                  "y_start": 465.0,
                  "page_start": 1,
                  "page_end": 1,
                  "text": "section 45(3)(a) or (b) or (c);"
                },
                {
                  "type": "sub-clause",
                  "number": "x",
                  "id": "202-2-a-x",
                  "x": 55.0,
                  "y_start": 480.0,
                  "page_start": 1,
                  "page_end": 1,
                  "text": "section 46"
                },
                {
                  "type": "sub-clause",
                  "number": "xi",
                  "id": "202-2-a-xi",
                  "x": 55.0,
                  "y_start": 465.0,
                  "page_start": 1,
                  "page_end": 1,
                  "text": "section 47(1)(a); and"
                },
                {
                  "type": "sub-clause",
                  "number": "xii",
                  "id": "202-2-a-xii",
                  "x": 55.0,
                  "y_start": 480.0,
                  "page_start": 1,
                  "page_end": 1,
                  "text": "Chapter VIII other than the provisions of section 124(1) and 124(2), or 125(2) or 146; and"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "b",
              "id": "202-2-b",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 415.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "without set off of—",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "sub-clause",
                  "number": "i",
                  "id": "202-2-b-i",
                  "x": 55.0,
                  "y_start": 465.0,
                  "page_start": 1,
                  "page_end": 1,
                  "text": "any loss carried forward or depreciation from any earlier tax year, if such loss or depreciation is attributable to any of the deductions referred to in clause (a); or"
                },
                {
                  "type": "sub-clause",
                  "number": "ii",
                  "id": "202-2-b-ii",
                  "x": 55.0,
                  "y_start": 480.0,
                  "page_start": 1,
                  "page_end": 1,
                  "text": "any loss under the head \"Income from house property\" with any other head of income; and"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "c",
              "id": "202-2-c",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 430.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "without any exemption or deduction for allowances or perquisite, called by any name, provided under any other law in force.",
              "children": []
            }
          ],
          "text_after_clauses": ""
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "3",
          "id": "202-3",
          "x": 27.62,
          "y_start": 380.0,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text_before_clauses": "The loss and depreciation referred to in sub-section (2)(b) shall be deemed to have been given full effect to and no further deduction for such loss or depreciation shall be allowed for any subsequent year.",
          "clauses": [],
          "text_after_clauses": ""
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "4",
          "id": "202-4",
          "x": 27.62,
          "y_start": 380.0,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text_before_clauses": "Nothing contained in sub-section (1) shall apply to a person, where an option is exercised by such person under this section, in such manner as may be prescribed, for any tax year, and such option is exercised,—",
          "clauses": [
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "a",
              "id": "202-4-a",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 395.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "in case of a person having income from business or profession,—",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "sub-clause",
                  "number": "i",
                  "id": "202-4-a-i",
                  "x": 55.0,
                  "y_start": 465.0,
                  "page_start": 1,
                  "page_end": 1,
                  "text": "on or before the due date specified under section 263(1) for furnishing the returns of income for such tax year;"
                },
                {
                  "type": "sub-clause",
                  "number": "ii",
                  "id": "202-4-a-ii",
                  "x": 55.0,
                  "y_start": 480.0,
                  "page_start": 1,
                  "page_end": 1,
                  "text": "such option, once exercised, shall apply to subsequent tax years;"
                },
                {
                  "type": "sub-clause",
                  "number": "iii",
                  "id": "202-4-a-iii",
                  "x": 55.0,
                  "y_start": 465.0,
                  "page_start": 1,
                  "page_end": 1,
                  "text": "such option, once exercised, may be withdrawn only once for a tax year other than the tax year for which it was exercised; and"
                },
                {
                  "type": "sub-clause",
                  "number": "iv",
                  "id": "202-4-a-iv",
                  "x": 55.0,
                  "y_start": 480.0,
                  "page_start": 1,
                  "page_end": 1,
                  "text": "after such withdrawal, the person shall never be eligible to exercise the option under this sub-section, except where such person ceases to have any income from business or profession, and in such a case the option under clause (b) shall be available;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "b",
              "id": "202-4-b",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 415.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "in case of a person not having income from business or profession, along with the return of income to be furnished under section 263(1) for the tax year.",
              "children": []
            }
          ],
          "text_after_clauses": ""
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "5",
          "id": "202-5",
          "x": 27.62,
          "y_start": 380.0,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text_before_clauses": "In case of a person, having a Unit in the International Financial Services Centre, the provisions of sub-section (2) shall be modified to the extent that deduction under section 147 shall be available to such Unit subject to fulfilment of the conditions contained in that section.",
          "clauses": [],
          "text_after_clauses": ""
        }
      ],
      "text_after_subsections": ""
    }
  ],
